      "id": "overview",
      "title": "## Overview",
      "content": "This plan outlines a modern, visually stunning, and highly interactive website for Kokum & Coast, a fictional Mumbai-based restaurant. The site will feature a filterable menu with online ordering capabilities, a reservation system, a gallery, and essential restaurant information, all built with a warm, coastal-modern aesthetic and optimized for performance and accessibility."
    },
    {
      "id": "key-features",
      "title": "## Key features",
      "content": "- **View Restaurant Information**: Displays essential details such as address, opening hours, phone number, and email.\n- **View Menu Listing**: Shows all food and beverage items available at the restaurant, organized by category.\n- **Filter Menu Items**: Allows users to filter the menu by course or dietary tags (e.g., vegan, seafood).\n- **View Menu Item Details**: Displays detailed information for a specific menu item, including description and price.\n- **Add Menu Item to Cart**: Allows users to add selected menu items to a shopping cart.\n- **View Shopping Cart**: Displays the items currently in the user's shopping cart.\n- **Checkout Order**: Facilitates the process of completing an online food order.\n- **Submit Reservation Form**: Allows visitors to book a table at the restaurant.\n- **View Review Listing**: Displays customer reviews for the restaurant.\n- **Submit Review**: Allows customers to submit their own reviews.\n- **View Gallery Listing**: Displays a collection of images in an Instagram-style grid.\n- **View Gallery Item Details**: Shows a larger view of a selected image from the gallery.\n- **View Location**: Displays the restaurant's location on an embedded Google Map.",
